{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wondered what lies beyond the forest? Could it be that the foe you fear the most is the one that grants you the greatest strength?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234670/extras/7115fc6245d6b01a3ed8cda1b1a22713.avif?t=1738870216\" data-has-big width=800 height=515 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <i>Twig</i>, our brave heroine on a mission to save her land from a looming danger. Follow her path, forage, craft\u00a0and unveil the mysteries hidden deep within the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234670/extras/0cbb9fb317248c9272c638dce1473178.poster.avif?t=1738870216\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234670/extras/0cbb9fb317248c9272c638dce1473178.webm?t=1738870216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234670/extras/0cbb9fb317248c9272c638dce1473178.mp4?t=1738870216\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not Us is a solitaire style card game where you forage for plants, manage your inventory, and try to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234670/extras/8d9972862ae6efdde4b8b36a791c26c8.poster.avif?t=1738870216\" width=796 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234670/extras/8d9972862ae6efdde4b8b36a791c26c8.webm?t=1738870216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234670/extras/8d9972862ae6efdde4b8b36a791c26c8.mp4?t=1738870216\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When you're not foraging, resting</strong> or spending time in the alchemy lab, you travel the countryside of a land torn apart by wild magic. By your side: two trusty familiars \u2014 the cunning and loyal Lizard, as well as the wise and supportive Goat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234670/extras/21e9afdb4a6dc36c01d03c17f47e0926.poster.avif?t=1738870216\" width=768 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234670/extras/21e9afdb4a6dc36c01d03c17f47e0926.webm?t=1738870216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234670/extras/21e9afdb4a6dc36c01d03c17f47e0926.mp4?t=1738870216\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn more about Twig</strong> and the society that spawned her, with a tragic history that yet teeters on the dark edge of a future unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234670/extras/47d438970d5d5c8a386619eb9b95ce30.poster.avif?t=1738870216\" width=776 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234670/extras/47d438970d5d5c8a386619eb9b95ce30.webm?t=1738870216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234670/extras/47d438970d5d5c8a386619eb9b95ce30.mp4?t=1738870216\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find and use the potential</strong> of that which grows in a land driven mad by magic! Extract, dilute and infuse to both expand and upgrade your card collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How far will you go?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2234670?t=1738870216","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234670/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1738870216","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234670/077b94e65b54355295d174398bb33e9d36049a91/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1738870216","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234670/077b94e65b54355295d174398bb33e9d36049a91/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1738870216","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wondered what lies beyond the forest? Could it be that the foe you fear the most is the one that grants you the greatest strength?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234670/extras/7115fc6245d6b01a3ed8cda1b1a22713.avif?t=1738870216\" data-has-big width=800 height=515 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <i>Twig</i>, our brave heroine on a mission to save her land from a looming danger. Follow her path, forage, craft\u00a0and unveil the mysteries hidden deep within the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234670/extras/0cbb9fb317248c9272c638dce1473178.poster.avi